#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1823
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "Which ship system upgrade category are you wondering about?"
msgstr "Which ship system upgrade category are you wondering about?"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1827
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "beam"
msgstr "beam"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1831
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Beam upgrades refer to the beam weapons systems. They might include "
"additional beam mounts, longer range, faster recharge or cycle times, "
"increased damage, wider beam firing arcs or faster beam turret rotation "
"speed."
msgstr ""
"Beam upgrades refer to the beam weapons systems. They might include "
"additional beam mounts, longer range, faster recharge or cycle times, "
"increased damage, wider beam firing arcs or faster beam turret rotation "
"speed."

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1837
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1853
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1869
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1885
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1901
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1917
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1933
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "Back to ship upgrade category explanation list"
msgstr "Back to ship upgrade category explanation list"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1843
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "missiles"
msgstr "missiles"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1847
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Missile upgrades refer to aspects of the missile weapons systems. They might "
"include additional tubes, faster tube load times, increased tube size, "
"additional missile types or additional missile storage capacity."
msgstr ""
"Missile upgrades refer to aspects of the missile weapons systems. They might "
"include additional tubes, faster tube load times, increased tube size, "
"additional missile types or additional missile storage capacity."

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1859
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "shield"
msgstr "shield"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1863
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Shield upgrades refer to the protective energy shields around your ship. "
"They might include increased charge capacity (overall strength) for the "
"front, rear or both shield arcs or the addition of a shield arc."
msgstr ""
"Shield upgrades refer to the protective energy shields around your ship. "
"They might include increased charge capacity (overall strength) for the "
"front, rear or both shield arcs or the addition of a shield arc."

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1875
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "hull"
msgstr "hull"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1879
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Hull upgrades refer to strengthening the ship hull to withstand more damage "
"in the form of armor plating or structural bolstering."
msgstr ""
"Hull upgrades refer to strengthening the ship hull to withstand more damage "
"in the form of armour plating or structural bolstering."

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1891
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "impulse"
msgstr "impulse"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1895
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Impulse upgrades refer to changes related to the impulse engines. They might "
"include improving the top speed or acceleration (forward, reverse or both), "
"maneuvering speed or combat maneuver (boost, which is moving forward, or "
"strafe, which is sideways motion or both)."
msgstr ""
"Impulse upgrades refer to changes related to the impulse engines. They might "
"include improving the top speed or acceleration (forward, reverse or both), "
"manoeuvring speed or combat manoeuvre (boost, which is moving forward, or "
"strafe, which is sideways motion or both)."

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1907
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "ftl"
msgstr "ftl"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1911
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"FTL (short for faster than light) upgrades refer to warp drive or jump drive "
"enhancements. They might include the addition of an ftl drive, a change in "
"the range of the jump drive or an increase in the top speed of the warp drive"
msgstr ""
"FTL (short for faster than light) upgrades refer to warp drive or jump drive "
"enhancements. They might include the addition of an ftl drive, a change in "
"the range of the jump drive or an increase in the top speed of the warp drive"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1923
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "sensors"
msgstr "sensors"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1927
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Sensor upgrades refer to the ship's ability to detect other objects. They "
"might include increased long range sensors, increased short range sensors, "
"automated proximity scanners for ships or improved range for automated "
"proximity scanners."
msgstr ""
"Sensor upgrades refer to the ship's ability to detect other objects. They "
"might include increased long range sensors, increased short range sensors, "
"automated proximity scanners for ships or improved range for automated "
"proximity scanners."

